#. Description of the plugin
#: woocommerce-smart-coupons.php
msgid ""
"<strong>WooCommerce Smart Coupons</strong> lets customers buy gift "
"certificates, store credits or coupons easily. They can use purchased "
"credits themselves or gift to someone else."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Kupon Cerdas WooCommerce</strong> memungkinkan pelanggan membeli "
"sertifikat hadiah, kredit toko, atau kupon dengan mudah. Mereka dapat "
"menggunakan kredit yang dibeli sendiri atau memberikannya kepada orang lain."

