#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:596
msgid "Available coupons are not visible on Cart, Checkout & My Account page?"
msgstr ""
"Kupon yang tersedia tidak terlihat di halaman Keranjang, Pembayaran & Akun "
"Saya?"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:597
msgid ""
"Smart Coupons uses hooks of Cart, Checkout & My Account page to display "
"available coupons. If your theme is not using those hooks in cart, checkout "
"& my-account template, coupons will not be displayed."
msgstr ""
"Smart Coupons menggunakan kaitan halaman Cart, Checkout & My Account untuk "
"menampilkan kupon yang tersedia. Jika tema Anda tidak menggunakan kaitan "
"tersebut di template cart, checkout & my-account, kupon tidak akan "
"ditampilkan."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:600
msgid "How can I resend gift card coupon bought by customers?"
msgstr ""
"Bagaimana cara mengirimkan ulang kupon kartu hadiah yang dibeli pelanggan?"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:601
msgid "You can resend them from order admin edit page."
msgstr "Anda dapat mengirimkannya ulang dari halaman edit admin pesanan."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:604
msgid ""
"Uncheck \"Auto-generate\" option in Store Credit is not saving? Is it always "
"checked?"
msgstr ""
"Hapus centang opsi \"Buat otomatis\" di Store Credit tidak menyimpan? Apakah "
"selalu dicentang?"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:605
msgid ""
"Store Credit's default behavior is auto-generate because, when using a store "
"credit, it's balance keeps reducing. Therefore it should be uniquely created "
"for every user automatically."
msgstr ""
"Perilaku default Store Credit adalah pembuatan otomatis karena, saat "
"menggunakan store credit, saldonya terus berkurang. Oleh karena itu, store "
"credit harus dibuat secara unik untuk setiap pengguna secara otomatis."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:608
msgid "Smart Coupons is not sending emails."
msgstr "Kupon Cerdas tidak mengirimkan email."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:609
msgid ""
"Smart Coupons sends email only after order completion. So make sure that "
"order complete email is enabled and sending. If enabled, then make sure all "
"settings of coupons, products are in place. Also check by switching your "
"theme."
msgstr ""
"Smart Coupons hanya mengirimkan email setelah pesanan selesai. Jadi, "
"pastikan email pesanan selesai diaktifkan dan terkirim. Jika diaktifkan, "
"pastikan semua pengaturan kupon dan produk sudah sesuai. Periksa juga dengan "
"mengganti tema Anda."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:612
msgid "\"Store Credit Receiver detail\" form not appearing on checkout page?"
msgstr ""
"Formulir \"Detail Penerima Kredit Toko\" tidak muncul di halaman pembayaran?"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:613
msgid ""
"This form is displayed using a hook which is available in My Account "
"template. Make sure your theme's my-account template contains all hooks "
"required for that template. Update your theme if it is not updated."
msgstr ""
"Formulir ini ditampilkan menggunakan hook yang tersedia di template Akun "
"Saya. Pastikan template akun saya tema Anda berisi semua hook yang "
"diperlukan untuk template tersebut. Perbarui tema Anda jika belum diperbarui."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:616
