#. translators: Documentation link for 'How to Print Coupons'
#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:618
msgid "How to Print Coupons"
msgstr "Cara Mencetak Kupon"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:621
msgid ""
"Is it possible to have a coupon for each variation of the variable product?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah mungkin untuk mendapatkan kupon untuk setiap variasi produk variabel?"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:622
msgid ""
"From version 4.11.0, you can add/link coupons to product variations as well. "
"This feature is not available in a version lower than 4.11.0."
msgstr ""
"Mulai versi 4.11.0, Anda juga dapat menambahkan/menautkan kupon ke variasi "
"produk. Fitur ini tidak tersedia pada versi yang lebih rendah dari 4.11.0."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:625
msgid "Is Smart Coupons compatible with WooCommerce Subscriptions?"
msgstr "Apakah Kupon Cerdas kompatibel dengan Langganan WooCommerce?"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:626
msgid "Yes, Smart Coupons does work with WooCommerce Subscriptions."
msgstr "Ya, Kupon Cerdas dapat digunakan dengan Langganan WooCommerce."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:629
msgid "Which features of Smart Coupons work with Subscriptions?"
msgstr "Fitur Kupon Cerdas mana yang berfungsi dengan Langganan?"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:630
msgid ""
"Give away a discount or credit on signing up a subscription, give away "
"recurring discount or credits, apply credit during sign up, automatic "
"payment for renewals from credit (Note: When using PayPal Standard Gateway, "
"store credit can be applied only during sign up. Automatic payment for "
"renewals by credit will not work for PayPal Standard Gateway)."
msgstr ""
"Berikan diskon atau kredit saat mendaftar langganan, berikan diskon atau "
"kredit berulang, terapkan kredit saat mendaftar, pembayaran otomatis untuk "
"pembaruan dari kredit (Catatan: Saat menggunakan PayPal Standard Gateway, "
"kredit toko hanya dapat diterapkan saat mendaftar. Pembayaran otomatis untuk "
"pembaruan dengan kredit tidak akan berfungsi untuk PayPal Standard Gateway)."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:633
msgid "How does automatic payment by store credit work with Subscriptions?"
msgstr ""
"Bagaimana cara kerja pembayaran otomatis melalui kredit toko dengan "
"Langganan?"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:634
msgid ""
"Customers can apply store credit on a subscription during purchase of "
"subscription. If the same store credit has sufficient balance, it'll keep "
"applying it to renewals till the remainder in store credit is higher than "
"renewal price. Customers will be able to apply store credit only during "
"signup. They will not get an option to apply store credit in renewals. But "
"if the store credit will not have sufficient balance to pay for the renewals,"
" then the order will go into pending mode. Now when the customer will go to "
"pay for this renewal order, they'll get an option to apply store credit "
"again. To activate the subscription again, the customer will have to pay for "
"the renewals. When the customer is paying for the renewals from their "
"account, then in that process they can use the same store credit which "
"didn't have the sufficient balance, again & pay for the remaining amount."
msgstr ""
"Pelanggan dapat menggunakan kredit toko pada langganan selama pembelian "
"langganan. Jika kredit toko yang sama memiliki saldo yang cukup, maka akan "
"terus menggunakannya untuk pembaruan hingga sisa kredit toko lebih tinggi "
"dari harga pembaruan. Pelanggan hanya dapat menggunakan kredit toko selama "
"pendaftaran. Mereka tidak akan mendapatkan opsi untuk menggunakan kredit "
"toko dalam pembaruan. Namun, jika saldo kredit toko tidak cukup untuk "
"membayar pembaruan, maka pesanan akan masuk ke mode tertunda. Sekarang, "
"ketika pelanggan akan membayar pesanan pembaruan ini, mereka akan "
"mendapatkan opsi untuk menggunakan kredit toko lagi. Untuk mengaktifkan "
"langganan lagi, pelanggan harus membayar pembaruan. Ketika pelanggan "
"membayar pembaruan dari akun mereka, maka dalam proses tersebut mereka dapat "
"menggunakan kredit toko yang sama yang tidak memiliki saldo yang cukup, lagi "
"& membayar jumlah yang tersisa."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:637
msgid ""
"Is it possible to partially pay for a subscription with store credit and the "
"remainder by another method?"
msgstr ""
"Apakah mungkin untuk membayar sebagian langganan dengan kredit toko dan "
"sisanya dengan metode lain?"

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:638
msgid ""
"No, this is possible only in those cases where subscription amount is more "
"than store credit's balance. If store credit's balance is more than "
"subscription's total then your bank account or credit card will not be "
"charged."
msgstr ""
"Tidak, hal ini hanya mungkin dilakukan jika jumlah langganan lebih besar "
"dari saldo kredit toko. Jika saldo kredit toko lebih besar dari total "
"langganan, maka rekening bank atau kartu kredit Anda tidak akan ditagih."

#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:641
