#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:645
msgid ""
"I'm using WPML & WPML provides support for multi-currency, but Smart Coupons "
"only changes currency symbol & the price value remains same. Can Smart "
"Coupons change the currency symbol and the price value associated with it?"
msgstr ""
"Saya menggunakan WPML & WPML menyediakan dukungan untuk berbagai mata uang, "
"tetapi Smart Coupons hanya mengubah simbol mata uang & nilai harganya tetap "
"sama. Dapatkah Smart Coupons mengubah simbol mata uang dan nilai harga yang "
"terkait dengannya?"

#. translators: Link for the plugin 'Aelia Currency Switcher for WooCommerce'
#: includes/class-wc-sc-admin-welcome.php:647
